4.png", "id": "596900934606025", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974493_596900937939358_8440058348608412887_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=aN4gOFrZV14Q7kNvwEYTX-t&_nc_oc=AdrWLZYfI1pequi6430OKeYw0lm6f_8WJAgd4Xm1D5g_XT5IAitycnWCoAnrOBxEGFY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5kf1PCpfigQ0Rsml3zfDxx9_yoJnGtYS5nKfm9X01UcQ&oe=6A19B540"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3972111622876679", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036670_3972111626210012_8202621689105994921_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GVfsY3vRPj8Q7kNvwFYf9xt&_nc_oc=AdpIAQ-Lz1xZ5Wbgbtyvrh0b51laatgHAnIefFx0PjIJasmuG376FcJZ4jbnAXN7E4I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4AKGhuCzWSNLIdgh-bauEOFGFsVxGrq6GS1fBCnT6gGA&oe=6A19BA73"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PartyON (Beta Release)", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PartyOn. Turn on your party cell.\n\nExperience virtual parties like never before with live karaoke sessions, sports nights, to virtual chats. All packed inside the PartyOn.\n\nCreate virtual rooms, invite friends, or jump into random spaces hosted by party and music aficionados around the world. Never go out when there's PartyOn!\n\nUnique Features:\n\nAwesome Lively Avatars\nCustomize your own full-body 3D avatar like a true rock star! Comes with a range of facial expressions and gestures.\n\nImmersive and Gorgeous Virtual Rooms\nSing your heart out from nightclubs to outer space. Ignite that party mood in places unimaginable.\n\nSelection of Songs and MV Content\nTop popular songs by the hundreds, infused with virtual super-effects and avatar animations to blast your senses to the stars.\n\nReal-Time Social Interactions\nSophisticated audio systems for truly one-of-a-kind party spaces, chat and interact with fun and wonky objects/emojis as you enjoy live singing from around the globe. \n", "short_description": "PartyOn. Turn on your party cell.\n\nExperience virtual parties like never before with live karaoke sessions, sports nights, to virtual chats. All packed inside the PartyOn.\n\nCreate virtual rooms, invite friends, or jump into random spaces hosted by party and music aficionados around the world. Never go out when there's PartyOn!\n"}, {"images": {"nodes": []}, "id": "802167254029424", "locale": "zh_TW", "screenshots": [], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "PartyOn", "keywords": [], "long_description": "PartyOn\uff0c\u6253\u958b\u4f60\u7684\u6d3e\u5c0d\u7d30\u80de\n\nPartyOn\u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u4ee5VR\u865b\u64ecKTV\u70ba\u4e3b\u6253\uff0c\u4e14\u7d50\u5408\u904b\u52d5\u8cfd\u4e8b\u89c0\u770b\u3001\u793e\u7fa4\u4ea4\u53cb\u7b49\u9818\u57df\u7684\u6d3e\u5c0d\u5a1b\u6a02App\u3002\n\n\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u8f15\u9b06\u5275\u5efa\u865b\u64ec\u7a7a\u9593\u4e26\u9080\u8acb\u597d\u53cb\u540c\u6a02\uff0c\u6216\u662f\u96a8\u6027\u8df3\u9032\u4efb\u4e00\u7a7a\u9593\uff0c\u8207\u4e16\u754c\u5404\u5730\u71b1\u611b\u6d3e\u5c0d\u548c\u97f3\u6a02\u7684\u4eba\u76f8\u9047\u3001\u4ee5\u6b4c\u6703\u53cb\uff0c\u4e0d\u7528\u51fa\u9580\u4e5f\u80fd\u76e1\u60c5\u72c2\u6b61\uff01\n\n\u7279\u8272\u529f\u80fd\uff1a\n\n\u751f\u52d5\u7684\u865b\u64ec\u5316\u8eab\u5f62\u8c61\n\u4f60\u53ef\u4ee5\u5ba2\u88fd\u7cbe\u7f8e\u7684\u5168\u8eab\u865b\u64ec\u5316\u8eab\uff0c\u81ea\u7531\u88dd\u626e\u4f60\u7684\u660e\u661f\u98a8\u683c\uff0c\u4ee5\u751f\u52d5\u7684\u80a2\u9ad4\u548c\u8868\u60c5\u5c55\u73fe\u81ea\u6211\u3002\n\n\u6c89\u6d78\u65bc\u83ef\u9e97\u865b\u64ec\u7a7a\u9593\n\u60f3\u5728\u591c\u5e97\u5305\u5ec2\u4f86\u9996\u6292\u60c5\u6b4c\uff0c\u9084\u662f\u98db\u4e0a\u592a\u7a7a\u76e1\u60c5\u5636\u543c\uff1f\u63a2\u7d22\u8d85\u73fe\u5be6\u7684\u865b\u64ec\u5834\u666f\uff0c\u5728\u60f3\u50cf\u4e0d\u5230\u7684\u5730\u65b9\u9ad8\u6b4c\u4e00\u66f2\uff01\n\n\u512a\u8cea\u6b4c\u66f2\u548c\u81ea\u9078MV\n\u5167\u5efa\u6578\u767e\u9996\u83ef\u8a9e\u3001\u591a\u8a